CLAUDE.md
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
venv/
.venv/
# identity files — contain private keys, never commit
*.json
data/
!installer/data/
!installer/data/**
!android/app/src/main/java/network/nevod/data/
!android/app/src/main/java/network/nevod/data/**
# public, signed release manifest — not a secret, must be committed (see
# update_checker.py / nevod.py release sign). RELEASE.sig isn't matched by
# *.json but listed for clarity.
!RELEASE.json
!RELEASE.sig
# Xcode asset catalog manifests — structural (declares imageset/colorset
# contents), not secrets. Without this, *.json above silently excluded the
# whole Assets.xcassets folder from git (confirmed: 0 files tracked before
# this line existed) — Contents.json missing breaks the asset catalog for
# anyone else checking out the repo (Xcode, CI, ...). Was scoped to only
# ios/Nevod/Nevod/Assets.xcassets at first — same gap silently caught
# Preview Content/Preview Assets.xcassets (broke Xcode Cloud's first
# archive: DEVELOPMENT_ASSET_PATHS pointed at an effectively-empty,
# never-committed folder) and SLKey/Assets.xcassets (missing per-imageset
# Contents.json → "has 3 unassigned children" warnings for every image
# set) — both found 2026-08-29. Broadened to every .xcassets anywhere
# under ios/, present or future, so this class of bug can't recur.
!ios/**/*.xcassets/**/*.json
# public, curator-signed bootstrap manifest bundled into the iOS app — not a
# secret (only the curator's private key, kept offline, is). See
# node/curator_sign.py and MD_Discuss/DISCUSS_NODE_ADMISSION.md.
!ios/Nevod/Nevod/nodes.json
# Curator-signed official accounts (public signatures, not secrets) — bundled resource,
# referenced by the Xcode project; missing from git = Xcode Cloud build fails.
!ios/Nevod/Nevod/official.json

# PyInstaller build output — generated binaries, not source
installer/build/
installer/dist/
/build/
/dist/
# generated PDFs and scripts
*.pdf
generate_*.py
# macOS
.DS_Store
# Xcode user data
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/
